--- !u!114 &1725368917
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1725368915}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 08605a3b6e1a3ea4e96c92ea348d9495, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RuleBook
  pages:
  - chapter: INTRODUCTION
    title: How to Inspect a File
    rules:
    - badge: A
      title: Review
      body: Compare what the owner declared with the rules in this handbook. The
        owner's notes never override a rule.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 0
    - badge: B
      title: Scan
      body: Press X-RAY SCAN to see the floor plan. Red marks show structural damage.
        Yellow FE marks show fire extinguishers.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 0
    - badge: C
      title: Decide
      body: Approve only if the file breaks no rule. To reject, mark every rule the
        file breaks on the rejection slip.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 0
  - chapter: CHAPTER 1
    title: Documentation
    rules:
    - badge: 1.1
      title: Report Date
      body: Inspection files filed before 01 Sep 2025 are outdated. An outdated report
        cannot be approved.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 1
    - badge: 1.2
      title: Seal and Signature
      body: Every file must be signed by the owner and carry the official agency
        seal. If either one is missing, the file is invalid.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 1
  - chapter: CHAPTER 2
    title: Structural Integrity (No Exceptions)
    rules:
    - badge: 2.1
      title: Load-Bearing System
      body: If the report mentions physical damage to columns or beams, such as cuts,
        large cracks, thinning or deterioration, the building is marked for demolition
        regardless of its age.
      structural: 1
      rejectTag: 1
    - badge: 2.2
      title: Commercial Ground Floors
      body: Buildings with a business on the ground floor (shop, market, car dealer,
        warehouse) must include a Load-Bearing Wall Supplement. If it is missing,
        the file cannot be approved.
      structural: 1
      rejectTag: 1
  - chapter: CHAPTER 3
    title: Life Safety
    rules:
    - badge: 3.1
      title: Fire Extinguisher
      body: The X-RAY floor plan must show at least one fire extinguisher (yellow
        FE mark).
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 1
    - badge: 3.2
      title: Emergency Exits
      body: All emergency exits must be open and accessible. Locked or blocked exits
        are grounds for rejection.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 1
    - badge: 3.3
      title: Emergency Bag
      body: The emergency bag must contain water, a flashlight, a first aid kit and
        a whistle. If any item is missing, the bag is incomplete.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 1
  - chapter: CHAPTER 4
    title: Integrity of the Inspector
    rules:
    - badge: 4.1
      title: Bribery
      body: Money, gifts or envelopes attached to a file are bribes. Reject the file
        and cite this rule. Letters from architects or engineers are not bribes.
      structural: 0
      rejectTag: 1
