  m_text: "<b>FROM:</b> Central Building Inspection Agency\n<b>TO:</b> Inspector,
    Desk 4\n<b>SUBJECT:</b> Your shift\n\nWelcome back, inspector. Your shift runs
    from 08:00 to 17:00. Review every file in the Case Files folder before the bell
    rings.\n\n\u2022 Approve a file only if it breaks no rule.\n\u2022 To reject
    a file, cite every rule it breaks.\n\u2022 Use X-RAY SCAN on every file. Damage
    is not always declared.\n\u2022 The Rule Book folder holds the full regulations
    (press R).\n\n\u2022 Click every field on a file to check it against its rule.
    You can only approve or reject once every field and the X-RAY are checked.\n\nWhen
    the bell rings, leave your desk and go to the crisis monitor on the wall. Your
    night shift starts right after.\n\n\u2014 BIA Management"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed8007a70ca003b48b2f37a786107a09, type: 2}
